OL,3,GOrkney & Shetland
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FSoon turning
OL,6,Fdrier across Shetland, although the
OL,7,Fodd shower still possible. Then mainly
OL,8,Fdry with some clear spells developing
OL,9,Fovernight. Fresh southwest winds at
OL,10,Ftimes.
OL,11,
OL,12,CWednesday:FIt will be bright with the
OL,13,Fbest of the sunshine across Orkney. A
OL,14,Fscattering of showers and winds
OL,15,Fturning into the west, these strong at
OL,16,Ftimes in Shetland.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
