OL,3,GOrkney & Shetland
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Thursday to Saturday:
OL,6,FBright with occasional sunny or clear
OL,7,Fspells. Showers, these most widespread
OL,8,Fand heavy on Friday and Saturday.
OL,9,FMainly moderate southwest winds.
